/-!+# Proper simple sections of the six remaining sporadic models

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined
1 March 2004 manuscript, Theorem 0.1.2(5) and condition K, printed pp.4 and
482. The targets here are the concrete J₂, J₃, J₄, HS, He and Ru carriers
specified in `ClassificationModels.Families`, and groups isomorphic to them.

The quotient-to-section assembly is proved and re-exported here. It uses
only finite simple carrier inclusions when passing to the parent's full K.
The six proper-quotient classifications remain separate inputs to be proved;
this module does not yet assert the sporadic proper-K clause.
-/
